        "agronomic_recommendation": "For Wheat, monitor FAO-56 root-zone depletion. Implement alternate wetting and drying (AWD) if growing Boro rice."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Crop & Land Cover Classification Inference",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/crop/classify",
      "curl_example": "curl -X POST 'http://localhost:8000/crop/classify' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"features\": {\"Blue_B02\": 0.12, \"Green_B03\": 0.16, \"Red_B04\": 0.14, \"NIR_B08\": 0.38, \"SWIR1_B11\": 0.22, \"NDVI_Rabi\": 0.46, \"NDWI_McFeeters\": -0.40, \"NDMI_Moisture\": 0.26, \"EVI_Rabi\": 0.48, \"Delta_NDVI_Kharif_Rabi\": 0.18}}'",
      "expected_response": {
        "predicted_class_id": 1,
        "predicted_class_name": "Cropland",
        "confidence": 0.82,
        "probabilities": {
          "Cropland": 0.82,
          "Tree_Cover": 0.08,
          "Permanent_Water": 0.02,
          "Built_Up": 0.08
        },
        "model_type": "ExtraTreesClassifier (Spatial Block Evaluated: 79.8% Accuracy)",
        "ground_truth_status": "VALIDATED for Agricultural Cropland vs Tree/Water/Built-Up. Field-level crop species (Rice/Wheat/Maize) BLOCKED.",
        "note": "In strict compliance with scientific integrity rules, crop species (Rice vs Wheat vs Maize) are not fabricated without verified DAE field GPS boundary survey data. Model reliably identifies active Cropland boundaries for AgriSense crop rotation planning."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Available Cartographic Maps & GIS Vectors",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/maps/available",
